			id: "51A17E17A5C0DE14"
			title: "Starcharging"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["51A17E17A5C0DE02"]
			description: [
				"&aTinkers and add-on materials&r"
				""
				"Tinkers add-on materials are discovered alongside base Tinkers materials. Native Tinkers traits stay authoritative; SilentTinkers never flattens every special effect into generic numbers."
				""
				"Reverse conversion into Silent Gear is tracked separately because Tinkers traits often depend on live tool context and cannot be copied safely as plain NBT."
